    "biography": "<p>Essentially sailboats, methane skiffs usually come in a catamaran configuration, with two sleek, flat hulls for stability. Since only hulder morphs can survive prolonged immersion in Titan’s methane lakes, stability is key. Hazers and other morph types generally wear vacsuits when sailing methane skiffs. Piloting a methane skiff requires a special skill, Pilot: Sailboat.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Rimward, p. 194.</em></p>",
